7	 * @parblock
8	 * AGU throughput stress: 2 source loads + data-ALU + store/reload/store chain,
9	 * maximizing address-generation pressure (3 ldr + 2 str per element).
10	 * Rotation uses {add, eor, and, orr} (proposal variant; differs from
11	 * mrn_nuke_2src_alu's {add,sub,eor,and} — tests rotation-composition
12	 * robustness). Skeleton identical to mrn_nuke_2src_alu.
13	 * @endparblock
14	 */
